{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eclipsium is a first-person horror game where you play as the desperate Wanderer. In search of Her, his path leads through hellish tombs, cathedrals of flesh and even through space, immolating himself and sacrificing anything to achieve his goal.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t stop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.poster.avif?t=1760822417\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.webm?t=1760822417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.mp4?t=1760822417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no safety or comfort in Eclipsium. Let the pale light guide you through, as every place hides its own path to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the spiral</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.poster.avif?t=1760822417\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.webm?t=1760822417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.mp4?t=1760822417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything fades and senses dull in this endless darkness. But with you remains your power - a twisting, transmuting hand, ready to carve a way through whatever stands before you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find her</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.poster.avif?t=1760822417\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.webm?t=1760822417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.mp4?t=1760822417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her weak light, now little more than a whisper of a memory, pulls you forward. Even if it\u2019s a lure, it remains your only hope inside the anguished eclipse.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Deeper into Greater Pain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419670/d9908bf57be302144b851d1f86c8281962abc1eb.jpg"},{"name":"What a Curious Feeling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419670/cbd570f61703fe0577b1d50d61625be5ae1ce7be.jpg"},{"name":"End of Eclipsium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419670/f3885d4c521c84fc42dabb2b4547f2984ceead29.jpg"},{"name":"Schjerfbeck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419670/0696cd0936defcc2532941509bd1392c618a826e.jpg"},{"name":"With Eyes Unclouded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419670/8e7fef5d7411fbd61b503f450cd0f5c2f6b222c5.jpg"},{"name":"Key to the Bottomless Pit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2419670/0610946ee181632301e2234183194b6d9239a441.jpg"},{"name":"Cold Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta